  "explicit_non_claims": [
    "The core module does not implement cryptographic signatures or trust-root storage.",
    "A successful signature only authenticates the statement issuer and exact bytes under a configured trust policy.",
    "Issuer authority scope does not prove the issuer knows every hidden provider or transit dependency.",
    "A SCITT receipt proves transparency registration or inclusion, not statement correctness.",
    "A gNMI device/controller inventory is not automatically a complete end-to-end physical topology.",
    "The initial verified maturity is issuer_attested, not corroborated or measured.",
    "Confidence values are not ranking evidence unless a trusted applicable calibration profile is verified.",
    "Mock verifier tests are not cryptographic integration tests or production trust qualification.",
    "No sensitive subscriber topology or management identifiers are required to be written to a public DHT."
